WEBVTT

00:06.690 --> 00:08.400
A long, long time ago...

00:08.400 --> 00:11.220
The Gods of the skies, known as the Heavenly people,

00:12.070 --> 00:16.510
fought a huge war against the humans of the Lower World.

00:19.770 --> 00:24.080
It was a battle fought over the almighty power that can create anything-

00:25.270 --> 00:27.620
the Akuto.

04:07.620 --> 04:10.500
I like rainy days.

04:12.990 --> 04:16.070
It's the only time when I can see the same sky as everyone else.

04:18.180 --> 04:20.050
Next, on to other news.

04:20.690 --> 04:25.060
Yesterday, a giant tsunami suddenly appeared off the coast of Kisuido.

04:25.060 --> 04:31.120
It is speculated that the abnormal weather of recent years is the cause of this downburst phenomenon.

04:32.350 --> 04:35.970
Yumemi, stop daydreaming and eat your breakfast.

04:36.650 --> 04:37.840
All right...

04:37.840 --> 04:41.660
Sis, you never eat properly because you're always eating junk food.

04:41.660 --> 04:42.540
Shut up!

04:47.680 --> 04:49.170
I'm leaving.

04:50.730 --> 04:51.630
Huh?

04:55.150 --> 04:57.450
Oh, the rain stopped.

05:16.320 --> 05:17.820
Hey!

05:19.720 --> 05:21.630
Yumemi, good morning!

05:21.630 --> 05:22.830
Morning!

05:23.290 --> 05:25.830
Good morning, Ichiko and Suzume!

05:27.770 --> 05:31.560
Suzume, you're not in elementary school anymore.

05:39.870 --> 05:41.350
Are they floating up there again?

05:47.210 --> 05:47.960
Yeah.

05:49.350 --> 05:53.440
I wonder what the floating islands that only you can see are...

05:54.100 --> 05:56.440
There's something wrong with my head.

05:58.130 --> 06:01.200
Stupid. Only you can see it, and that's how it is.

06:02.020 --> 06:04.420
However, the problem is Suzume.

06:04.420 --> 06:07.510
She messages me about her love life every day. It's so tiring.

06:07.510 --> 06:09.620
His name is Kazuya-kun, right?

06:09.620 --> 06:13.210
I'm already overworked by my after-school activities.

06:13.210 --> 06:15.120
I think it's cute.

06:15.120 --> 06:16.250
I guess so.

06:16.250 --> 06:18.770
But Suzume is too naïve.

06:27.250 --> 06:29.230
What's wrong, Yumemi?

06:31.380 --> 06:32.270
Yumemi?

06:32.920 --> 06:34.360
Oh, it's noth-

06:48.770 --> 06:49.930
It's you.

06:50.520 --> 06:52.460
I found you, Girl of Destiny.

06:53.300 --> 06:54.410
There's no time left.

06:55.050 --> 06:56.960
Lend me your power.

06:57.750 --> 06:59.470
This is...

07:00.770 --> 07:01.300
Come on.

07:03.430 --> 07:05.430
Damn! The space-time continuum...

07:07.210 --> 07:10.190
Hey, you can hear my voice, right?

07:12.150 --> 07:14.060
There's no time, so come to me!

07:14.940 --> 07:15.360
Hey-

07:15.540 --> 07:16.410
Yumemi!

07:19.090 --> 07:20.860
What just happened?

07:21.190 --> 07:24.080
What do you mean? What happened?

07:24.980 --> 07:26.830
Ichiko, didn't you see that?

07:26.830 --> 07:27.870
See what?

07:32.770 --> 07:34.560
This is the space-time continuum...

07:35.920 --> 07:40.630
I couldn't even touch that girl...

07:43.490 --> 07:47.930
So now, I have to use the power only available to an Outsider, is that it?

07:52.770 --> 07:53.590
Munto...

07:54.740 --> 08:01.650
Do you plan on interfering with the space-time
continuum in order to save this sinking kingdom?

08:02.280 --> 08:05.660
You do know that's breaking the taboo of the Heavens.

08:05.660 --> 08:07.110
I won't let you go easily.

08:08.510 --> 08:09.550
Calm down.

08:10.220 --> 08:12.410
I did not come to stop you.

08:14.490 --> 08:15.380
Gass...

08:16.290 --> 08:21.380
Even though you're the Guardian of Time, you're going to let me pass through?

08:22.330 --> 08:25.180
The fate of the Heavens has already been decided.

08:25.730 --> 08:29.390
Even if I curse you right now, I won't be able to stop the destruction of the world.

08:30.860 --> 08:35.100
Ever since that calamitous day in the distant past,

08:35.100 --> 08:39.080
I've lost the object which has been passed
down to Outsiders for generations to guard.

08:39.860 --> 08:42.860
There's nothing left for me to guard in this place.

08:43.110 --> 08:46.640
Did you come here to tell me such meaningless things?

08:47.340 --> 08:49.370
You're free to choose whether to give up or not.

08:49.750 --> 08:52.330
But, if an Outsider goes against his fate...

08:52.810 --> 08:54.330
I know.

08:56.160 --> 08:58.840
Munto, answer a question for me.

09:00.330 --> 09:02.090
What did you see?

09:03.160 --> 09:06.080
The almighty power, Akuto, is running out.

09:06.080 --> 09:07.840
This world is going to fall.

09:08.600 --> 09:13.560
What exactly did you see from that darkness-filled world?

09:19.450 --> 09:20.360
A girl.

09:22.190 --> 09:24.970
I dreamt of a girl.

09:31.410 --> 09:32.960
I will not let the Heavens fall.

09:33.940 --> 09:36.870
It is my sworn duty as king.

09:37.990 --> 09:41.420
I will definitely get past that wall.

09:44.780 --> 09:45.920
This girl?

09:46.400 --> 09:48.540
That's right, Toche.

09:49.170 --> 09:52.870
She is the key to opening the future of the Heavens.

09:52.870 --> 09:55.890
The Girl of Destiny who appeared in Munto's vision.

09:57.530 --> 10:01.010
Lord Munto has finally found the clue to saving the world...

10:01.810 --> 10:03.940
...but at the cost of your eyesight, Lady Ryuely...

10:04.330 --> 10:07.950
Toche, don't keep bringing up the past.

10:08.760 --> 10:10.740
I'm sorry, Lady Ryuely.

10:12.330 --> 10:20.560
The United Army plans to bring down the Magical Kingdom to stem the discharge of Akuto to avert the Akuto crisis.

10:21.030 --> 10:25.600
But it's very difficult to open the futures of the Heavens without the powers of this girl.

10:26.640 --> 10:27.990
Lady Ryuely...

10:27.990 --> 10:33.140
If this continues, the seven continents of the Heavens will all fall to the Lower World.

10:33.790 --> 10:36.720
Don't say that out loud!

10:37.700 --> 10:40.980
None of your predictions have ever been wrong...

10:41.550 --> 10:46.190
A future that has been foreseen cannot be changed by anyone.

10:47.410 --> 10:51.990
However, you must face the reality of <i>your future.</i>

10:53.000 --> 10:54.890
Munto saw it.

10:54.890 --> 10:57.490
He saw that small light hidden in the depths of the darkness.

10:58.300 --> 11:00.000
The key to open the future.

11:00.920 --> 11:04.980
In order to obtain it, Munto left the Heavens.

11:05.860 --> 11:11.320
We, the Heavenly people, will disappear if we fall to the Lower World.

11:11.320 --> 11:13.270
It will be the same for Lord Munto.

11:13.270 --> 11:16.260
But the Girl of Destiny is there.

11:17.690 --> 11:24.150
However, I don't see how she holds the power to open the future of the Heavens...

11:25.500 --> 11:28.150
Toche, have faith in Munto.

11:29.920 --> 11:33.700
Lady Ryuely, who <i>is this girl, exactly?</i>

11:34.930 --> 11:37.390
She is as you see.

11:38.340 --> 11:43.080
The Girl of Destiny is just an ordinary child with unlimited possibilities.

11:44.140 --> 11:47.960
She's like you, an ordinary child.

12:15.290 --> 12:18.640
Don't they know they're up against magical deities?

12:18.640 --> 12:19.410
Gass!

12:33.980 --> 12:36.520
It seems like I've underestimated the powers of an Outsider.

12:37.020 --> 12:39.140
All hands, disperse at once. Hurry!

12:46.240 --> 12:50.500
Gass... How dare he interfere when he's an Outsider!

12:50.500 --> 12:52.120
This is not good.

12:52.120 --> 12:59.160
The longer the battle lasts, the more Akuto will be spent.

12:59.580 --> 13:06.390
We must quickly eliminate the Magical Kingdom, so we can manage what is left of the Akuto energy.

13:06.390 --> 13:08.170
If not, the kingdoms of the Heavens will...

13:08.480 --> 13:15.400
Why is a neutral Outsider protecting the Magical Kingdom?

13:18.210 --> 13:21.560
The sixth pillar of the Magical Kingdom has been taken down.

13:21.560 --> 13:25.680
There's 48 hours until the sinking of the Magical Kingdom.

13:25.680 --> 13:27.190
Lord Gntarl, according to reports,

13:27.190 --> 13:30.270
their king left the Heavens to go to the Lower World.

13:30.540 --> 13:32.530
Is your source credible?

13:33.190 --> 13:38.280
According to some soldier witnesses, their king left on his own will.

13:38.610 --> 13:40.140
This is the footage of it.

13:41.310 --> 13:42.510
Impossible...

13:42.510 --> 13:44.040
Their king...

13:44.390 --> 13:48.040
Unbelievable! That man abandoned the Heavens...

13:48.300 --> 13:51.120
The Lower World is a world of death without Akuto.

13:51.120 --> 13:54.050
Why is their king committing suicide?

13:56.760 --> 13:59.980
Committing suicide? That's ridiculous.

13:59.980 --> 14:02.430
Munto, what are you scheming?

14:03.960 --> 14:06.350
That girl's world and mine...

14:07.810 --> 14:09.410
...are in a different time and space.

14:09.410 --> 14:11.490
Yet, it's the same world, like the opposite sides of a coin.

14:13.320 --> 14:17.260
But, there's a fine line that I cannot cross.

14:18.700 --> 14:20.880
This is harder than I thought.

14:23.750 --> 14:29.620
Ryuely, I'm still far away from the future of the Heavens that you showed me.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.980
The power of that girl...

14:52.870 --> 14:56.070
...is the future of this world.

14:59.430 --> 15:01.320
Yes, I get it.

15:01.320 --> 15:05.500
But, regardless of how hard I try, I still can't see the sky that you see.

15:05.500 --> 15:06.660
I believe you, though.

15:06.980 --> 15:08.610
I believe it exists.

15:08.610 --> 15:11.240
But that red-haired guy seems like trouble.

15:11.240 --> 15:14.300
My instincts tell me he's dangerous.

15:14.300 --> 15:19.840
So Yumemi, don't think about him anymore.

15:20.520 --> 15:22.090
Are you listening?

15:22.410 --> 15:25.390
Hello? I'm worrying about you.

15:25.390 --> 15:26.790
I'm sorry.

15:26.790 --> 15:29.290
Jeez, I'm serious, here.

15:29.290 --> 15:31.690
Suzume, you think so too, right?

15:35.420 --> 15:38.760
Gosh, have you even been following our conversation?

15:38.760 --> 15:41.010
You're worried about Yumemi too, right?

15:41.010 --> 15:42.630
Yeah, I am.

15:42.630 --> 15:43.740
Really?

15:44.860 --> 15:47.280
It's not a laughing matter.

15:48.120 --> 15:52.770
Hey, Suzume. Is it going well with your boyfriend, Kazuya-kun?

15:52.770 --> 15:53.300
Yeah!

15:55.350 --> 15:57.420
Some things just don't make sense in this world.

15:57.420 --> 16:00.770
Like... Why do you have a boyfriend when I don't?

16:00.770 --> 16:03.510
I'm tired. Let's go.

16:06.490 --> 16:07.720
Yumemi! Ichiko!

16:10.310 --> 16:11.680
You know...

16:11.680 --> 16:14.690
I'm going to marry Kazuya tomorrow.

16:33.430 --> 16:36.960
Takashi knows a little about Kazuya-kun.

16:36.960 --> 16:37.880
What did he say?

16:39.530 --> 16:42.450
I've heard it too.

16:42.450 --> 16:45.240
Kazuya-kun is a real troublemaker...

16:45.240 --> 16:46.560
Isn't that just a rumor?

16:46.560 --> 16:49.050
Takashi's information can't really be trusted...

16:49.050 --> 16:52.990
He said he injured the third-year gym teacher the other day.

16:54.940 --> 16:59.550
He was suspended and is now grounded at home.

16:59.550 --> 17:02.080
I wonder if Suzume will be all right...

17:02.080 --> 17:04.320
I'm getting more and more worried about her.

17:05.930 --> 17:07.130
Suzume!

17:07.130 --> 17:07.750
Huh?

17:10.840 --> 17:12.620
Right in the face...

17:14.720 --> 17:18.710
Hey, Yumemi, sometimes I think Suzume is a little slow.

17:18.710 --> 17:20.750
Do you think she's being taken advantage of?

17:20.750 --> 17:22.360
I don't think so.

17:22.360 --> 17:24.840
She may be innocent, but she knows what's going on...

17:24.840 --> 17:28.760
But we're only thirteen!

17:34.770 --> 17:37.770
I'll meet Kazuya-kun and see what he's like.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.810
I thought you'd say that.

17:39.810 --> 17:40.770
I'll go with you.

17:41.020 --> 17:43.690
I've already found out where he lives.

17:47.700 --> 17:50.920
Gass, the only Outsider in the Heavens.

17:51.440 --> 17:57.970
You are a cursed magical deity attached to all Heavenly people, yet why do you protect the Magical Kingdom?

17:58.340 --> 18:00.550
You say I'm protecting this kingdom?

18:00.550 --> 18:00.960
What?

18:01.810 --> 18:05.530
People who cling on to the dulled power of Akuto wouldn't understand.

18:05.530 --> 18:08.070
You bastard, how dare you insult us!

18:08.070 --> 18:09.160
Don't take offense.

18:09.160 --> 18:12.640
It is this Akuto crisis that has dulled your thinking.

18:16.470 --> 18:21.680
However, there's someone who's still looking at the truth in this chaos.

18:22.150 --> 18:25.190
He is trying to avert this danger and open a future.

18:33.620 --> 18:35.410
Gass, the pillar is...

18:46.770 --> 18:56.180
The Heavenly people were the closest beings to God when the Akuto was at its fullest.

18:56.510 --> 19:03.240
At that time, we transformed the Akuto
into various powers to use as we pleased.

19:03.240 --> 19:08.740
We thought the Akuto would last forever, but it has its limits.

19:08.740 --> 19:15.290
But even after knowing this, the Heavenly people continued to waste the Akuto.

19:15.290 --> 19:21.210
The Heavenly people lacked courage to face the truth.

19:21.390 --> 19:25.820
Not long after that, the Heavenly people lost their future and gave up all hope.

19:25.820 --> 19:30.070
They started a war across the world because their hearts were filled with confusion.

19:30.070 --> 19:35.720
We lost our hearts at the thought of losing the Akuto.

19:35.900 --> 19:40.670
But the Heavenly beings rose up from the edge of despair.

19:40.670 --> 19:44.520
There is truth in that which has limits.

19:44.520 --> 19:50.410
It took them a long time to realize that simple fact.

19:50.410 --> 19:55.830
After that, the Heavenly people
sealed away their godlike powers.

19:55.830 --> 20:00.530
They gave up their desires and lived frugally in order to utilize the remaining Akuto to its fullest.

20:00.530 --> 20:06.870
In that moment, it felt like the
Heavenly people had surpassed God.

20:06.870 --> 20:11.440
In any case, now the Akuto is losing its energy even more rapidly.

20:11.440 --> 20:17.230
And the countries of the Heavens are in danger of disappearing.

20:17.230 --> 20:22.060
The Heavenly people's enduring patience will be wasted.

20:22.060 --> 20:26.020
We need time to find what is causing the Akuto crisis...

20:26.020 --> 20:29.670
...and find a solution.

20:29.670 --> 20:37.840
If we eliminate Munto and that Magical Kingdom of his that overuses Akuto,

20:37.840 --> 20:42.910
this hemorrhaging of Akuto can be stopped.

20:43.210 --> 20:44.480
Don't worry.

20:44.480 --> 20:47.420
The battle is going as planned.

20:48.350 --> 20:54.480
Thanks to your good work, the Magical Kingdom will fall very soon.

20:54.480 --> 20:58.180
Then we will be able to fully avert the crisis of the Heavens.

20:58.650 --> 21:02.020
But there's one problem.

21:02.020 --> 21:03.250
Look at this.

21:03.250 --> 21:04.840
That's...

21:04.840 --> 21:06.100
Munto?

21:06.100 --> 21:08.480
He's still alive!

21:08.480 --> 21:13.650
However, there's no Akuto there. It's just a matter of time before he disappears.

21:13.950 --> 21:17.120
Elders, I must remind you.

21:17.120 --> 21:18.990
Our opponent is Munto.

21:18.990 --> 21:23.630
I find it hard to believe that he fell to the Lower World just to die.

21:23.630 --> 21:24.470
You're right.

21:24.470 --> 21:29.460
Munto must've fallen of his own accord to distract us.

21:29.460 --> 21:32.280
He must be up to something.

21:32.280 --> 21:36.430
He's formulating a counterattack in that land of death.

21:36.670 --> 21:39.900
We must do something, Gntarl.

21:45.730 --> 21:46.940
This is...

21:46.940 --> 21:52.460
During the times of God, the Heavenly people used this automaton of death for battle.

21:52.460 --> 21:55.950
It is an invincible warrior made of concentrated Akuto.

21:56.160 --> 21:58.900
We will send this after Munto.

21:58.900 --> 22:03.810
If Munto gets attacked by this automaton in a place with no Akuto while he's already on the verge of death...

22:03.810 --> 22:07.570
No matter how strong he is, he won't last more than a few hours.

22:19.760 --> 22:21.050
Over there!

22:46.430 --> 22:47.580
Kazuya-kun?

24:31.890 --> 24:33.180
What is that?

24:33.520 --> 24:37.520
The people of the Lower World are getting sucked into a giant iron box...

24:37.520 --> 24:39.000
Watch out, Girl of Destiny!

24:39.000 --> 24:40.420
You'll be taken to the underworld!

24:40.420 --> 24:42.560
Munto, this is a train.

24:43.270 --> 24:46.760
Next episode of The World Reflected in the Eyes of a Girl who Looks Up at the Sky:

24:47.410 --> 24:48.340
Running away.
